# ─── Workspace root .gitignore ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo (langmuir-workspace) tracks the layer ABOVE the nine service repos:
# docs, the sync scripts, Epicor reference, and the Apps Script sources.
#
# The nine service folders below are their own GitHub repos and clone INTO this
# folder. Git must not try to track them here, or you get nested-repo chaos.

# ─── The nine service repos (cloned by scripts/bootstrap.sh) ──────────────────
/pms/
/pms-test/
/ci/
/hub/
/procurement/
/scheduling/
/tooling/
/vision/
/bom/

# ─── Retired code ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# _archive/ is 22 MB of superseded systems and contains nested .git folders
# (_archive/kpi/.git, _archive/cyclecount/.git) plus a node_modules tree.
# The code itself is preserved by archiving the LangmuirProductionKPI and
# CycleCount repos on GitHub, which is the right home for it.
/_archive/
/_to_delete/

# ─── Large binaries git handles badly ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 18 MB of product drawings. Belongs in Drive or the PDM system, not git.
/Apollo First Production Run Revisions/

# Presentation decks, not system files
*.pptx

# ─── Real production data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Exported stock movements, 890 KB of real transactions. Matches the data files
# only, in any directory. scripts/import-inv-history.sh is tooling and IS tracked.
inv-history*.json

# ─── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.clasprc.json
*.pem
*.key
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*

# ─── Noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vscode/
.idea/
~$*

# ─── Per-machine git transport override ───────────────────────────────────────
# scripts/config.sh resolves SSH vs HTTPS by machine. Drop a config.local.sh
# next to it to force one. It is machine-specific and must never be committed.
scripts/config.local.sh
